{"4784950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GENESIS Protocol", "steam_appid": 4784950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is no longer born. It is authorized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken to an unfamiliar world and a body the system refuses to explain. Under the rule of <strong>CORE</strong>, society has been rebuilt around the <strong>GENESIS Protocol</strong> — a mandate that controls reproduction, identity, and human existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover who you truly are, what happened in the past, and why the truth seems to elude you at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/4b77fa862e1aaba680bd8d6e6fd0b41f.poster.avif?t=1780500835\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/4b77fa862e1aaba680bd8d6e6fd0b41f.webm?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/4b77fa862e1aaba680bd8d6e6fd0b41f.mp4?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Health. Only Heart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique heart-rate health system replaces traditional life bars. Taking damage sends your pulse climbing, pushing you closer to 'catastrophic cardiac disassembly'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/3aaee9f49018e6356e2f8f97cdd93ebf.poster.avif?t=1780500835\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/3aaee9f49018e6356e2f8f97cdd93ebf.webm?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/3aaee9f49018e6356e2f8f97cdd93ebf.mp4?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Turns. Modern Violence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hybrid AATB battle system blends classic turn-based strategy with dynamic action timing. Plan your moves, watch the action bar, and unleash cinematic attacks with brutal cyberpunk impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/2020b48386360421940c38b72451c282.poster.avif?t=1780500835\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/2020b48386360421940c38b72451c282.webm?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/2020b48386360421940c38b72451c282.mp4?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Looting is Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge lockers, crates, and even enemy corpses for valuable resources, cybernetic upgrades, medical supplies, weapons, and random junk that might just keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/1cbd6491263fdafe781a3b1824fc9724.poster.avif?t=1780500835\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/1cbd6491263fdafe781a3b1824fc9724.webm?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/1cbd6491263fdafe781a3b1824fc9724.mp4?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aim to Kill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills demand more than a menu click. Time your strikes, execute input combinations, mash through pressure, or directly target enemies to land stronger hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/42180a525413d3a300d6472aeee966a4.poster.avif?t=1780500835\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/42180a525413d3a300d6472aeee966a4.webm?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/42180a525413d3a300d6472aeee966a4.mp4?t=1780500835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is no longer born. It is authorized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken to an unfamiliar world and a body the system refuses to explain. Under the rule of <strong>CORE</strong>, society has been rebuilt around the <strong>GENESIS Protocol</strong> — a mandate that controls reproduction, identity, and human existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover who you truly are, what happened in the past, and why the truth seems to elude you at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784950/extras/4b77fa862e1aaba680bd8d6e6fd0b